    "summary": "All 9 question pages and original proceedings pages 41 and 47–67 were visually read by the same Astra reader. Boundary pages 46 and 68 were visually inspected separately to establish the complete theory-solution boundary; no other proceedings pages are claimed as read. The intact constants table on original PDF 41 is explicitly attributed. The original 17 independent problems and native a–e/a–c parts are retained. Source solution derivations and marking points are transcribed, with printed inconsistencies explicitly noted. All 11 actual final crops were visually inspected with snapping disabled; the protostar crop was widened after inspection and its replacement inspected. No separate model checker. Every final actual crop was personally visually inspected by the same Astra reader. No separate model checker.",
    "sourceGaps": [
      "The problem PDF's constants table has missing equation glyphs; the intact matching table and logarithm formula were recovered from original proceedings PDF41, explicitly attributed. The full147-page proceedings file and hash are retained, with a declared reading scope of41 and47–67.",
      "Printed solution inconsistencies are retained and annotated: Q1 numerical solar mass19.99 versus table1.99; Q10 intermediate omits field factor/unit; Q12 negative sign and3.21/3.19 mismatch; Q15 signed−1.5 and referenced but absent Figures1/2; Q16(d) denominator minus sign; Q17 final m−5.2 versus preceding m+5.2. No missing figure or correction was invented."
    ],
